{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52610","headline":"示法达偈三首 三 · 慧能","name":"示法达偈三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心迷法华转，心悟转法华。\n诵经久不明（《灯录》作「诵久不明已」），与义作雠家。\n无念念即正，有念念成邪。\n有无俱不计，长御白牛车。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}